    "engine": "jupyter",
    "markdown": "---\ntitle: Column Labels\njupyter: python3\nhtml-table-processing: none\nguide-section: Table Structure\nbread-crumbs: false\n---\n\nColumn labels are the primary way readers identify what data each column contains. Raw DataFrame\ncolumn names are often abbreviated, inconsistently cased, or full of underscores.\nPresentation-ready column labels are one of the highest-impact improvements you can make to a table,\nand they require very little effort.\n\nBeyond simple labels, **Great Tables** lets you group related columns together under spanner labels,\nreorder columns for clarity, and customize label text with rich formatting. This page walks through\neach of these capabilities.\n\n## Working with Column Data\n\nThe table's **Column Labels** part contains, at a minimum, columns and their *column labels*. The\nlast example had a single column: `population`. Just as in the **Stub**, we can create groupings called\n*spanner labels* that encompass one or more columns.\n\nTo better demonstrate how **Column Labels** work and are displayed, let's use an input data table\nwith more columns. In this case, that input table will be made from `gibraltar`, which has weather\nobservations from the Gibraltar Airport Station. We'll keep these of its columns:\n\n- `temp`: the air temperature in degrees Celsius (&deg;C)\n- `humidity`: the relative humidity, as a value between `0` and `1`\n- `wind_speed`: the wind speed in meters per second (m s<sup>&minus;1</sup>)\n- `pressure`: the atmospheric pressure in hectopascals (hPa)\n- `date`, `time`: the date and time of the observation\n\nThe date and time columns are placed last here, so that we can move them later on.\n\n::: {#b58227df .cell execution_count=1}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\nfrom great_tables import GT, html\nfrom great_tables.data import gibraltar\n\ngibraltar_mini = gibraltar.head(10)[[\"temp\", \"humidity\", \"wind_speed\", \"pressure\", \"date\", \"time\"]]\n\ngibraltar_mini\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=1}\n```{=html}\n<div>\n<style scoped>\n    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n        vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n        vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .dataframe thead th {\n        text-align: right;\n    }\n</style>\n<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n      <th></th>\n      <th>temp</th>\n      <th>humidity</th>\n      <th>wind_speed</th>\n      <th>pressure</th>\n      <th>date</th>\n      <th>time</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th>0</th>\n      <td>18.9</td>\n      <td>0.68</td>\n      <td>6.7</td>\n      <td>1015.2</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>00:20</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>1</th>\n      <td>18.9</td>\n      <td>0.73</td>\n      <td>7.2</td>\n      <td>1015.2</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>00:50</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>2</th>\n      <td>17.8</td>\n      <td>0.77</td>\n      <td>6.7</td>\n      <td>1014.6</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>01:20</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>3</th>\n      <td>18.9</td>\n      <td>0.73</td>\n      <td>6.7</td>\n      <td>1014.6</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>01:50</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>4</th>\n      <td>18.9</td>\n      <td>0.68</td>\n      <td>6.7</td>\n      <td>1014.6</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>02:20</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>5</th>\n      <td>17.8</td>\n      <td>0.73</td>\n      <td>6.7</td>\n      <td>1014.6</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>02:50</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>6</th>\n      <td>17.8</td>\n      <td>0.73</td>\n      <td>7.2</td>\n      <td>1014.6</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>03:20</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>7</th>\n      <td>17.8</td>\n      <td>0.73</td>\n      <td>6.3</td>\n      <td>1013.5</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>03:50</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>8</th>\n      <td>18.9</td>\n      <td>0.64</td>\n      <td>4.0</td>\n      <td>1014.6</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>04:20</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th>9</th>\n      <td>18.9</td>\n      <td>0.64</td>\n      <td>3.1</td>\n      <td>1014.6</td>\n      <td>2023-05-01</td>\n      <td>04:50</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\nThis ten-row subset of the Gibraltar weather dataset has both measurement and time columns, making it\na good candidate for organizing with column spanners.\n\n## Adding Column Spanners\n\nColumn spanners are most useful when you have a logical grouping of columns and want the reader to\ngrasp the table's structure at a glance. For example, grouping all measurement columns under\n\"Measurement\" and all date-related columns under \"Time\" immediately communicates the two-part nature\nof the data. Spanners work especially well in wide tables where the column count might otherwise feel\noverwhelming.\n\nLet's organize the time information under a `Time` *spanner label*, and put the other columns under\na `Measurement` *spanner label*. We can do this with the `~~GT.tab_spanner()` method.\n\n::: {#36730073 .cell execution_count=2}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\ngt_gibraltar = (\n    GT(gibraltar_mini)\n    .tab_header(\n        title=\"Weather at Gibraltar Airport\",\n        subtitle=\"Observations from the early hours of May 1, 2023\"\n    )\n    .tab_spanner(\n        label=\"Time\",\n        columns=[\"date\", \"time\"]\n    )\n    .tab_spanner(\n        label=\"Measurement\",\n        columns=[\"temp\", \"humidity\", \"wind_speed\", \"pressure\"]\n    )\n)\n\ngt_gibraltar\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=2}\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"yyfoakeetb\" style=\"padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:auto;width:auto;height:auto;\">\n<style>\n#yyfoakeetb table {\n          font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Fira Sans', 'Droid Sans', Arial, sans-serif;\n          -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n          -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n#yyfoakeetb thead, tbody, tfoot, tr, td, th { border-style: none; }\n tr { background-color: transparent; }\n#yyfoakeetb p { margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_table { display: table; border-collapse: collapse; line-height: normal; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; background-color: #FFFFFF; width: auto; border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: #A8A8A8; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #A8A8A8; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 2px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_caption { padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_title { color: #333333; font-size: 125%; font-weight: initial; padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; border-bottom-color: #FFFFFF; border-bottom-width: 0; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_subtitle { color: #333333; font-size: 85%; font-weight: initial; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; border-top-color: #FFFFFF; border-top-width: 0; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_heading { background-color: #FFFFFF; text-align: center; border-bottom-color: #FFFFFF; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_bottom_border { border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_col_headings { border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: #D3D3D3; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_col_heading { color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 100%; font-weight: normal; text-transform: inherit; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; vertical-align: bottom; padding-top: 5px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; overflow-x: hidden; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_column_spanner_outer { color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 100%; font-weight: normal; text-transform: inherit; padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 4px; padding-right: 4px; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_column_spanner_outer:first-child { padding-left: 0; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_column_spanner_outer:last-child { padding-right: 0; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_column_spanner { border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; vertical-align: bottom; padding-top: 5px; padding-bottom: 5px; overflow-x: hidden; display: inline-block; width: 100%; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_spanner_row { border-bottom-style: hidden; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_group_heading { padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 100%; font-weight: initial; text-transform: inherit; border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: #D3D3D3; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; vertical-align: middle; text-align: left; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_empty_group_heading { padding: 0.5px; color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 100%; font-weight: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: #D3D3D3; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; vertical-align: middle; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_from_md> :first-child { margin-top: 0; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_from_md> :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_row { padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; margin: 10px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: #D3D3D3; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; vertical-align: middle; overflow-x: hidden; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_stub { color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 100%; font-weight: initial; text-transform: inherit; border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_indent_1 { text-indent: 5px; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_indent_2 { text-indent: calc(5px * 2); }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_indent_3 { text-indent: calc(5px * 3); }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_indent_4 { text-indent: calc(5px * 4); }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_indent_5 { text-indent: calc(5px * 5); }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_stub_row_group { color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 100%; font-weight: initial; text-transform: inherit; border-right-style: solid; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; vertical-align: top; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_row_group_first td { border-top-width: 2px; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_row_group_first th { border-top-width: 2px; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_striped { color: #333333; background-color: #F4F4F4; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_table_body { border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: #D3D3D3; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_summary_row { color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; text-transform: inherit; padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_first_summary_row { border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_last_summary_row_top { border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_grand_summary_row { color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; text-transform: inherit; padding-top: 8px; padding-bottom: 8px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_first_grand_summary_row_bottom { border-top-style: double; border-top-width: 6px; border-top-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_last_grand_summary_row_top { border-bottom-style: double; border-bottom-width: 6px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_sourcenotes { color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 2px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_sourcenote { font-size: 90%; padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; text-align: left; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_left { text-align: left; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_center { text-align: center; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_right { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_font_normal { font-weight: normal; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_font_bold { font-weight: bold; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_font_italic { font-style: italic; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_super { font-size: 65%; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_footnotes { color: font-color(#FFFFFF); background-color: #FFFFFF; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 2px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_footnote { margin: 0px; font-size: 90%; padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_sourcenotes { color: #333333; background-color: #FFFFFF; border-bottom-style: none; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #D3D3D3; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 2px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_sourcenote { font-size: 90%; padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; text-align: left; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_footnote_marks { font-size: 75%; vertical-align: 0.4em; position: initial; }\n #yyfoakeetb .gt_asterisk { font-size: 100%; vertical-align: 0; }\n \n</style>\n<table class=\"gt_table\" data-quarto-disable-processing=\"false\" data-quarto-bootstrap=\"false\">\n<thead>\n\n  <tr class=\"gt_heading\">\n    <td colspan=\"6\" class=\"gt_heading gt_title gt_font_normal\">Weather at Gibraltar Airport</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr class=\"gt_heading\">\n    <td colspan=\"6\" class=\"gt_heading gt_subtitle gt_font_normal gt_bottom_border\">Observations from the early hours of May 1, 2023</td>\n  </tr>\n<tr class=\"gt_col_headings gt_spanner_row\">\n  <th class=\"gt_center gt_columns_top_border gt_column_spanner_outer\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"4\" scope=\"colgroup\" id=\"Measurement\">\n    <span class=\"gt_column_spanner\">Measurement</span>\n  </th>\n  <th class=\"gt_center gt_columns_top_border gt_column_spanner_outer\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\" scope=\"colgroup\" id=\"Time\">\n    <span class=\"gt_column_spanner\">Time</span>\n  </th>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"gt_col_headings\">\n  <th class=\"gt_col_heading gt_columns_bottom_border gt_right\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" scope=\"col\" id=\"temp\">temp</th>\n  <th class=\"gt_col_heading gt_columns_bottom_border gt_right\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" scope=\"col\" id=\"humidity\">humidity</th>\n  <th class=\"gt_col_heading gt_columns_bottom_border gt_right\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" scope=\"col\" id=\"wind_speed\">wind_speed</th>\n  <th class=\"gt_col_heading gt_columns_bottom_border gt_right\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" scope=\"col\" id=\"pressure\">pressure</th>\n  <th class=\"gt_col_heading gt_columns_bottom_border gt_right\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" scope=\"col\" id=\"date\">date</th>\n  <th class=\"gt_col_heading gt_columns_bottom_border gt_right\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" scope=\"col\" id=\"time\">time</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"gt_table_body\">\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">18.9</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.68</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">6.7</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1015.2</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">00:20</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">18.9</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.73</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">7.2</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1015.2</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">00:50</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">17.8</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.77</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">6.7</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1014.6</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">01:20</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">18.9</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.73</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">6.7</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1014.6</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">01:50</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">18.9</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.68</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">6.7</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1014.6</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">02:20</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">17.8</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.73</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">6.7</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1014.6</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">02:50</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">17.8</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.73</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">7.2</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1014.6</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">03:20</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">17.8</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.73</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">6.3</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1013.5</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">03:50</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">18.9</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.64</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">4.0</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1014.6</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">04:20</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">18.9</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">0.64</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">3.1</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">1014.6</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">2023-05-01</td>\n    <td class=\"gt_row gt_right\">04:50</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n\n</table>\n\n</div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Moving and Relabeling Columns\n\nWe can do two more things to make this presentable:\n\n- move the `Time` columns to the beginning of the series (using `~~GT.cols_move_to_start()`)\n- customize the column labels so that they are more descriptive (using `~~GT.cols_label()`)\n\nLet's do both of these things in the next example:\n\n::: {#17e266fc .cell execution_count=3}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\n(\n    gt_gibraltar\n    .cols_move_to_start(columns=[\"date\", \"time\"])\n    .cols_label(\n        date=\"Date\",\n        time=\"Time\",\n        temp=html(\"Temp,<br>&deg;C\"),\n        humidity=\"Humidity\",\n        wind_speed=html(\"Wind,<br>m s<sup>&minus;1</sup>\"),\n        pressure=html(\"Pressure,<br>hPa\")\n    )\n)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=3}\n```{=html}\n<div id=\"sprrsavzml\" style=\"padding-left:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:auto;width:auto;height:auto;\">\n<style>\n#sprrsavzml table {\n          font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Helvetica Neue', 'Fira Sans', 'Droid Sans', Arial, sans-serif;\n          -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n          -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n#sprrsavzml thead, tbody, tfoot, tr, td, th { border-style: none; }\n tr { background-color: transparent; }\n#sprrsavzml p { margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n #sprrsavzml .gt_table { display: table; border-collapse: collapse; line-height: normal; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; background-color: #FFFFFF; width: auto; border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: #A8A8A8; border-right-style: none; border-right-width: 2px; border-right-color: #D3D3D3; border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom-color: #A8A8A8; border-left-style: none; border-left-width: 2px; border-left-color: #D3D3D3; }\n #sprrsavzml .gt_caption { padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px; }\n #sprrsavzml .gt_title { color: #333333; font-size: 125%; font-weight: initial; padding-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 4px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; border-bottom-color: #FFFFFF; border-bottom-width: 0; }\n #sprrsavzml .gt_subtitle { color: #333333; font-size: 85%; font-weight: initial; padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 5px; padding-right: 5px; border-top-color: #FFFFFF; border-top-width: 0; }\n #sprrsavzml .gt_heading { background-color: #FFFFFF;